---
---

<section id="experience" class="w-full flex flex-col gap-6 scroll-mt-24">
	<!-- Section Header -->
	<div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[var(--fg)]">
		<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-[var(--accent)]">
			<rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="7" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"/>
		</svg>
		<h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Experience</h2>
	</div>

	<!-- Career Log Item -->
	<div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
		<!-- Role & Company Info -->
		<div class="flex flex-col gap-0.5">
			<span class="text-xs text-[var(--muted)] font-normal">
				2020 &mdash; Present &bull; Surabaya, Indonesia
			</span>
			<h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[var(--fg)] leading-snug">
				Senior Middleware Programmer <span class="text-[var(--muted)] font-normal">at</span> <span class="text-[var(--fg)] font-medium">PT Dwidasa Samsara Indonesia</span>
			</h3>
		</div>

		<!-- Bullet Points with Refined Typography -->
		<ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-[1.7] text-[var(--muted)] list-disc pl-4 marker:text-[var(--muted)]/60">
			<li>
				Architected and maintained containerized environments using <strong class="text-[var(--fg)] font-medium">Kubernetes</strong> and <strong class="text-[var(--fg)] font-medium">Docker</strong>, managing cluster orchestration with <strong class="text-[var(--fg)] font-medium">Rancher</strong> and centralized logging with <strong class="text-[var(--fg)] font-medium">Fluentd &amp; Kibana</strong>.
			</li>
			<li>
				Engineered foundational transaction routing (Overbooking, SKN National Clearing, RTGS) integrated with Tier-1 core banking systems, including <a href="https://fds.co.id/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--fg)] hover:text-[var(--accent)] underline decoration-[var(--border)] hover:decoration-[var(--accent)] underline-offset-4 transition-colors">FDS (T24 Core)</a> and <a href="https://aro.co.id/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--fg)] hover:text-[var(--accent)] underline decoration-[var(--border)] hover:decoration-[var(--accent)] underline-offset-4 transition-colors">ARO (Fincloud Core)</a>.
			</li>
			<li>
				Implemented real-time interbank money transfers and debit switching with national payment networks (<a href="https://artajasa.co.id/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--fg)] hover:text-[var(--accent)] underline decoration-[var(--border)] hover:decoration-[var(--accent)] underline-offset-4 transition-colors">Artajasa</a>, <a href="https://www.jaringanprima.co.id/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--fg)] hover:text-[var(--accent)] underline decoration-[var(--border)] hover:decoration-[var(--accent)] underline-offset-4 transition-colors">Rintis Prima</a>, <a href="https://www.alto.id/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--fg)] hover:text-[var(--accent)] underline decoration-[var(--border)] hover:decoration-[var(--accent)] underline-offset-4 transition-colors">Alto</a>) and Bank Indonesia's <strong class="text-[var(--fg)] font-medium">BI-FAST Controller</strong>.
			</li>
			<li>
				Built extensive <strong class="text-[var(--fg)] font-medium">QRIS</strong> payment engines (MPM/CPM, Cross-Border, TUNTAS, NFC), e-Money top-up pipelines (<strong class="text-[var(--fg)] font-medium">BCA Flazz, BNI TapCash</strong>), and biller integrations (<a href="https://pactindo.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--fg)] hover:text-[var(--accent)] underline decoration-[var(--border)] hover:decoration-[var(--accent)] underline-offset-4 transition-colors">PAC</a>, <a href="https://syb-online.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--fg)] hover:text-[var(--accent)] underline decoration-[var(--border)] hover:decoration-[var(--accent)] underline-offset-4 transition-colors">SYB</a>, <a href="https://jatelindo.co.id/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--fg)] hover:text-[var(--accent)] underline decoration-[var(--border)] hover:decoration-[var(--accent)] underline-offset-4 transition-colors">Jatelindo</a>).
			</li>
			<li>
				Developed digital lending automated background screening with <a href="https://jiarsi.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--fg)] hover:text-[var(--accent)] underline decoration-[var(--border)] hover:decoration-[var(--accent)] underline-offset-4 transition-colors">APJ</a> and connected services across Mobile Banking, ATMs, LOS, COB, STS, and Teller channels.
			</li>
		</ul>

		<!-- Tech Badges -->
		<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-1.5">
			<span class="squircle border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[var(--muted)] px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono">Golang</span>
			<span class="squircle border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[var(--muted)] px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono">Java</span>
			<span class="squircle border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[var(--muted)] px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono">Kubernetes</span>
			<span class="squircle border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[var(--muted)] px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono">Docker</span>
			<span class="squircle border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[var(--muted)] px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono">ISO 8583</span>
			<span class="squircle border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[var(--muted)] px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono">REST / SOAP</span>
			<span class="squircle border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[var(--muted)] px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono">PostgreSQL</span>
			<span class="squircle border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[var(--muted)] px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono">Redis</span>
			<span class="squircle border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[var(--muted)] px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono">NATS</span>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
